id: pm-csv-tbxy
title: Keep CodeQL action updates synchronized in one pull request
description: Bump every CodeQL workflow action to 4.37.9 together and group future Dependabot updates so init and analyze cannot produce mutually blocking pull requests.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T16:04:43.866Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T16:26:31.027Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T16:21:44.449Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T16:21:44.449Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
resolution: Pinned all CodeQL actions to one 4.37.9 commit and grouped the action family in Dependabot.
expected_result: CodeQL init and analyze share one revision and future bumps arrive in one pull request.
actual_result: Both workflow references use cdf488f and the regression test plus all repository gates pass.
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T16:17:29.591Z",pi-agent,"Updated init and analyze to the v4.37.9 commit cdf488f595d80d6e07e03d4674febd5ab45fa938 and added the github/codeql-action* Dependabot group. Verification passed: npm test (252 tests), npm run check, npm run docstring (95 declarations documented), and npm run coverage (100% lines, branches, and functions). Regression proof: after restoring both configuration files from origin/main, node --test test/codeql-dependabot.test.ts failed with exit 1 on the old db488d revision; restoring the changes made the test pass."
  "2026-08-30T16:26:31.027Z",pi-agent,Greptile correctly noted that pinning the regression expectation to cdf488f would block future grouped bumps. The test now derives the expected singleton from the first CodeQL reference and only enforces synchronization. Reverting both configuration files to origin/main still fails the test because the Dependabot group is absent; restoring them passes.
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/dependabot.yml,project,Groups future CodeQL action updates
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,Synchronizes every CodeQL action reference at 4.37.9
  test/codeql-dependabot.test.ts,project,Regression coverage for synchronized pins and Dependabot grouping
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  npm test,project,600,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T16:17:28.379Z",local_mutation,ci/bump-codeql-action-as-one-unit
close_reason: CodeQL actions now update atomically and the regression gate passes.
body: ""
